@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

title message发送与接收：<color red>标红为核心逻辑 <color green> 绿色：后续待补充
'自动对消息编号
autonumber
'自动激活关键字
autoactivate on
'设置间距
'skinparam ParticipantPadding 5
skinparam BoxPadding 20

actor 发送mq消息

box client
participant DefaultMQProducer
participant DefaultMQProducerImpl
participant MQClientInstance
participant MQClientAPIImpl
end box

box remoting
participant NettyRemotingClient
end box

box namesrv
participant DefaultRequestProcessor
participant RouteInfoManager
end box


box broker
participant SendMessageProcessor
end box

box store
participant DefaultMessageStore
end box

发送mq消息 -> DefaultMQProducer : send
DefaultMQProducer -> DefaultMQProducerImpl : sendDefaultImpl
note right
位置：org.apache.rocketmq.client.impl.producer.DefaultMQProducerImpl.sendDefaultImpl
end note

DefaultMQProducerImpl -> DefaultMQProducerImpl : <color red> tryToFindTopicPublishInfo

note right
1、获取Topic路由信息
- 尝试本地（ConcurrentMap<String/* topic */, TopicPublishInfo> topicPublishInfoTable）Topic路由信息
- 如果没有则从NameServer获取

end note
DefaultMQProducerImpl -> MQClientInstance : updateTopicRouteInfoFromNameServer
MQClientInstance -> MQClientAPIImpl : getTopicRouteInfoFromNameServer
note right
获取TopicPublishInfo
end note

MQClientAPIImpl -> NettyRemotingClient : invokeSync
note right
<color green> 发送同步消息（通过netty 后续完善）
end note
NettyRemotingClient -> DefaultRequestProcessor : processRequest

DefaultRequestProcessor -> DefaultRequestProcessor : getRouteInfoByTopic
DefaultRequestProcessor -> RouteInfoManager : pickupTopicRouteData
note right
根据topic获取路由信息
end note
return successfully
return successfully
return successfully
return successfully

'截止


MQClientInstance -> MQClientInstance : put
note right
1、brokerAddrTable
2、topicPublishInfoTable
2、topicSubscribeInfoTable
2、topicRouteTable
end note

deactivate MQClientInstance
return successfully
deactivate DefaultMQProducerImpl
DefaultMQProducerImpl -> DefaultMQProducerImpl : <color red> selectOneMessageQueue
note right
1、选择一个队列
- List<MessageQueue> messageQueueList
end note
deactivate DefaultMQProducerImpl
DefaultMQProducerImpl -> DefaultMQProducerImpl : <color red> sendKernelImpl
note right
1、发送消息核心方法
- 获取broker地址（ConcurrentMap<String/* Broker Name */, HashMap<Long/* brokerId */, String/* address */>> brokerAddrTable）
- 发送消息前后逻辑处理
- 发送消息
end note
DefaultMQProducerImpl -> MQClientInstance : findBrokerAddressInPublish
return successfully
note right
根据brokerName 获取broker地址
end note

DefaultMQProducerImpl -> MQClientAPIImpl : sendMessage
MQClientAPIImpl -> MQClientAPIImpl : sendMessageSync
MQClientAPIImpl -> NettyRemotingClient : invokeSync
note right
发送消息
end note
NettyRemotingClient -> SendMessageProcessor : processRequest
SendMessageProcessor -> SendMessageProcessor : sendMessage
note right
broker 存储消息
end note
SendMessageProcessor -> DefaultMessageStore : <color red> putMessage
note right
添加消息到 commitLog
end note

@enduml